        "description": {
          "text": "Added indication for treatment of Hospital-acquired/Ventilator-associated Bacterial Pneumonia (HABP/VABP) in adults 18 years and older",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for the use of FETROJA in patients 18 years of age and older for the treatment of Hospital-acquired Bacterial Pneumonia and Ventilator-associated Bacterial Pneumonia (HABP/VABP) caused by the following susceptible Gram-negative microorganisms: *Acinetobacter baumannii* complex, *Escherichia coli*, *Enterobacter cloacae* complex, *Klebsiella pneumoniae*, *Pseudomonas aeruginosa*, and *Serratia marcescens*.",
